AmeDreamChp5:
LOMA 0x4D
TILECHANGE 7
LOAD2 0 AmeDreamSleepChp5
CAM1 [9,12]
FadeBackBlack
STAL 240
SoundEffect(0x14A)
RECLASS 0xAA 0x1
STAL 120
Text(AmeGroggyChp5)
MOVE 3 0xAA [8,12]
ENUN
STAL 60
MOVE 3 0xAA [11,11]
ENUN
SoloTextboxCenter(AmeGroggy52)
MOVE 3 0xAA [9,11]
ENUN
SoloTextboxCenter(AmeGroggy53)
STAL 30
PlayEmotionEffect(0xAA,QuestionEffect)
STAL 45
Text(AmeGroggyChp54)
SoloTextboxCenter(AmeGroggyChp55)
LOAD1 0 KroniiCameoChp5
PlayEmotionEffect(0xAA,ExclamationEffect)
STAL 45
MOVE 5 0xAA [9,10]
ENUN
Text(AmeGroggyChp56)
MOVE 5 0xAA [9,9]
MOVE 5 0x38 [9,15]
ENUN
Text(AmeGroggyChp57)
MOVE 7 0x38 [9,13]
ENUN
SoloTextboxCenter(AmeGroggyChp58)
MOVE 10 0x38 [9,11]
FAWI 16
CLEARALL
LOMA 0x5
NoFade
ENDA








BeginningScene:
