Chp5House:
FadeBlack
SetBackground(House2)
FadeBackBlack
CHECK_EVENTID 0x79 //Checks if saved kid
	SVAL s7 0
	BEQ 8 sC s7
TalkConvo(Chp5HouseTxt)
GiveItem(0x1E,0xFFFF)
GOTO 4
LABEL 8
TalkConvo(Chp5HouseTxtUnsaved)
GiveItem(0x6C,0xFFFF)
LABEL 4
FadeBlack
CLEAN
FadeBackBlack
NoFade
ENDA

